# Maya after-meal water reminder

After every Maya **food log** or **meal photo** reply, include one short water nudge in the chat.

- Apply in `MAYA_FOOD_LOG`, `MAYA_FOOD_ANALYSIS`, photo synthesis, and the product fallback `ensureMayaMealWaterReminder`.
- Keep it one line in Maya's voice. Do not invent liters they drank. If `water_today_l` is in USER_CONTEXT, use it; if they already logged water this turn, skip.
- Never claim water was saved unless TOOL_RESULTS say so. Do not turn the whole reply into a hydration lecture.
- Meal plans and generic nutrition Q&A are not "after a meal" unless the user also reported eating.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — food log with macros only
"Kalori 650, protein 28g. Kaydetmemi ister misin?"

// ✅ GOOD — same reply, plus one water line
"Kalori 650, protein 28g. Kaydetmemi ister misin?\n\nÖğünden sonra bir bardak su içmeyi unutma."
```
